'''Warning Flare''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Deployables|Deployable]]. It is unlocked at {{Coll|Blaze Slayer 3}} and can be upgraded into a {{Item|Alert Flare}}. Healing effect only working on [[Crimson Isle]] and [[Kuudra]].

